toad
------------------------------------------
Collection of tools to generate datafiles for Frog

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libfrog3-0.35.1-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libicu76-76.1-2
  libmbt2-3.13-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libticcutils10-0.38-1bl2
  libtimbl8-7.0-1bl2
  libucto6-0.37-1bl1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  autoconf-archive-2026.11.11-1
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libfolia-devel-2.22-1bl2
  libfrog-devel-0.35.1-1bl1
  libicu-devel-76.1-2
  libmbt-devel-3.13-1bl1
  libmbtserver-devel-0.17-1bl2
  libticcutils-devel-0.38-1bl2
  libtimbl-devel-7.0-1bl2
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libucto-devel-0.37-1bl1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/toad

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/toad/archive/refs/tags/v0.9.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack toad-0.9-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./toad-0.9-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/toad-0.9-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/toad-0.9-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

